{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Island Beekeeper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become humanity\u2019s last hope in a world of floating islands!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is dying - disease, famine and decay have left people with only one chance: the miraculous honey from the skies. You are the chosen beekeeper sent above the clouds to harvest this precious resource and send it back to the survivors below. But the others who came before you never returned... Can you uncover their fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island Beekeeper</strong> is a cozy adventure about beekeeping and survival in a skybound world. Breed exotic bees, explore mysterious islands, build and upgrade your base, cook, experiment with alchemy and keep the balance between nature and humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1d <strong>Bees &amp; Hybrids</strong><br>Collect honey and tame wild bees of all kinds - forest, rain, frost and many more. Crossbreed them to create rare hybrids with unique traits and boost the quality of your honey. Care for your hives, maintain colony health and produce the most valuable nectar in the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/4b610b12c6fa405a218e6743420b36d2.poster.avif?t=1771913907\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/4b610b12c6fa405a218e6743420b36d2.webm?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/4b610b12c6fa405a218e6743420b36d2.mp4?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Upgrades &amp; Tools</strong><br>Expand your apiary, improve hives, extractors and equipment. Craft new tools for beekeeping and harvesting to increase productivity and refine your golden craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/b528ea17e3cff65b1c6b57105f70b6cc.poster.avif?t=1771913907\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/b528ea17e3cff65b1c6b57105f70b6cc.webm?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/b528ea17e3cff65b1c6b57105f70b6cc.mp4?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Crafting &amp; Alchemy</strong><br>Use alchemy to brew potions and elixirs that change your bees\u2019 behavior or enhance honey\u2019s properties. Mix ingredients, experiment freely and discover new recipes through curiosity and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/ef9c4c428779b6750b546a402114df03.poster.avif?t=1771913907\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/ef9c4c428779b6750b546a402114df03.webm?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/ef9c4c428779b6750b546a402114df03.mp4?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf73 <strong>Cooking &amp; Gardening</strong><br>Cook delicious meals and drinks using honey, fruits and mushrooms - from honey ale to hearty pies and rare infusions. Grow plants, create fragrant lures and improve your harvest quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/1b7baf55ed6e07886e9360e634d7b21c.poster.avif?t=1771913907\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/1b7baf55ed6e07886e9360e634d7b21c.webm?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/1b7baf55ed6e07886e9360e634d7b21c.mp4?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Exploration of the Sky Islands</strong><br>Fly on mechanical wings between floating biomes - from your cozy home island to wild, resource-rich lands. Explore forests, meadows and caves, gather materials, seeds and wax, trace the steps of lost beekeepers and uncover the secrets above the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/95783d755232941f133c6e5af3aa67a0.poster.avif?t=1771913907\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/95783d755232941f133c6e5af3aa67a0.webm?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/95783d755232941f133c6e5af3aa67a0.mp4?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd8 <strong>Meditative Gameplay &amp; Relaxation</strong><br>A peaceful space to unwind: tend to your garden, harvest honey, brew mead or repair your hives. Everything flows in a calm rhythm - under the hum of bees and the whisper of wind. This is your quiet refuge among the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/0297f1e692a36ec84642b8f054526924.poster.avif?t=1771913907\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/0297f1e692a36ec84642b8f054526924.webm?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/0297f1e692a36ec84642b8f054526924.mp4?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968160?t=1771913907","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968160?t=1771913907","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/5cec44eb9461fc16b800b998c5becf522456caf5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771913907","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/5cec44eb9461fc16b800b998c5becf522456caf5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771913907","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Island Beekeeper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become humanity\u2019s last hope in a world of floating islands!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is dying - disease, famine and decay have left people with only one chance: the miraculous honey from the skies. You are the chosen beekeeper sent above the clouds to harvest this precious resource and send it back to the survivors below. But the others who came before you never returned... Can you uncover their fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island Beekeeper</strong> is a cozy adventure about beekeeping and survival in a skybound world. Breed exotic bees, explore mysterious islands, build and upgrade your base, cook, experiment with alchemy and keep the balance between nature and humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1d <strong>Bees &amp; Hybrids</strong><br>Collect honey and tame wild bees of all kinds - forest, rain, frost and many more. Crossbreed them to create rare hybrids with unique traits and boost the quality of your honey. Care for your hives, maintain colony health and produce the most valuable nectar in the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/4b610b12c6fa405a218e6743420b36d2.poster.avif?t=1771913907\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/4b610b12c6fa405a218e6743420b36d2.webm?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/4b610b12c6fa405a218e6743420b36d2.mp4?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Upgrades &amp; Tools</strong><br>Expand your apiary, improve hives, extractors and equipment. Craft new tools for beekeeping and harvesting to increase productivity and refine your golden craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/b528ea17e3cff65b1c6b57105f70b6cc.poster.avif?t=1771913907\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/b528ea17e3cff65b1c6b57105f70b6cc.webm?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/b528ea17e3cff65b1c6b57105f70b6cc.mp4?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Crafting &amp; Alchemy</strong><br>Use alchemy to brew potions and elixirs that change your bees\u2019 behavior or enhance honey\u2019s properties. Mix ingredients, experiment freely and discover new recipes through curiosity and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/ef9c4c428779b6750b546a402114df03.poster.avif?t=1771913907\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/ef9c4c428779b6750b546a402114df03.webm?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/ef9c4c428779b6750b546a402114df03.mp4?t=1771913907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf73 <strong>Cooking &amp; Gardening</strong><br>Cook delicious meals and drinks using honey, fruits and mushrooms - from honey ale to hearty pies and rare infusions. Grow plants, create fragrant lures and improve your harvest quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/1b7baf55ed6e07886e9360e634d7b21c.poster.avif?t=1771913907\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968160/extras/1b7b